  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A particle of mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m\"></span> and charge <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"q\"></span> is accelerated from rest through a potential difference <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"V\"></span>. What is the final speed of the particle?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{\\frac{V}{2mq}}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{\\frac{2V}{mq}}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{\\frac{2qV}{m}}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{\\frac{qV}{2m}}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
  },
